<html>
<title>Why do I see F&M BASIC instead of COMX BASIC?</title>
<body>

<h1>Why do I see F&M BASIC instead of COMX BASIC?</h1>

<p>
One of the Expansion Box ROM versions includes a screen editor designed by F&M. When this ROM is active, BASIC is started with the F&M editor instead of the standard COMX BASIC environment. See the Emma 02 website <a href="https://www.emma02.hobby-site.com/comx_expansion.html">Expansion Box</a> section.
</p>

</body>
</html>
